on exitFrame
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 25 ........................... <the frame>
  [  4] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  6] sub ..................................... <the frame - 1>
  [  7] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame - 1>
  [  9] extcall 24 .............................. go(the frame - 1)
  [ 11] ret
end
